                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Ordering delivery, the tuna rice noodle and egg pancake was amazing! The rice noodles were chewy on the outside and the filling was substantial, with tuna and corn added – delicious! I also ordered the chicken rice noodle and egg pancake, which was equally good and very filling. The egg pancake definitely deserves five stars!\n\nThe toast was average; it was pre-crisped out of crust. The pork and tenderloin toast were okay, just average for a breakfast shop (I changed the paper bag to a plastic one for the kids). The black tea was a bit weak and too sweet, and the soy milk was just okay.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "點外送，鮪魚河粉蛋餅讚！河粉外皮很Q內餡紮實，鮪魚還有加玉米，好吃。再訪點卡拉雞河粉蛋餅一樣好吃，很有飽足感，蛋餅真的可以五星！\n吐司系列中規中矩，預設有去邊，豬肉和里肌吐司還OK，就是一般早餐店水準(已自行將店家紙袋換成塑膠袋方便小朋友吃)。飲料部分紅茶有點淡，偏甜，豆漿普通。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
